<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Fortune For You - 사주 기반 소개팅 플랫폼</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* Landing Page Specific Styles */
    body.landing-page {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    .landing-page-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3d4a7a 0%, #4a2d5c 25%, #5a3a6b 50%, #2d4a6b 75%, #1a3a5a 100%);
      background-size: 400% 400%;
      animation: gradientShift 15s ease infinite;
      padding: 20px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    @keyframes gradientShift {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    .landing-page-wrapper::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    }

    .landing-brand {
      position: absolute;
      top: 48px;
      left: 64px;
      z-index: 10;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .landing-brand-text {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .landing-brand-text .line1 {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .landing-brand-text .line2 {
      display: block;
    }

    .landing-card {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
      width: 700px;
      max-width: 90%;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 40px);
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      padding: 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin: 0 auto;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .landing-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .landing-logo-icon {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6A5AE0 0%, #8B7CF6 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
    }

    .landing-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111827;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .landing-subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6B7280;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .landing-question {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #6A5AE0;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .landing-features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .landing-feature {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #F9FAFB;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .landing-feature:hover {
      background: #F3F4F6;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .landing-feature-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .landing-feature-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
      margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    }

    .landing-feature-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .landing-cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .landing-cta-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .landing-btn {
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: inherit;
      border: none;
    }

    .landing-btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #4C1D95 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .landing-btn-primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #5B21B6 100%);
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.3);
    }

    .landing-btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #6A5AE0;
      border: 2px solid #6A5AE0;
    }

    .landing-btn-outline:hover {
      background: #6A5AE0;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .landing-footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #9CA3AF;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .landing-page-wrapper {
        padding: 12px;
      }

      .landing-brand {
        top: 16px;
        left: 16px;
      }

      .landing-brand-text {
        font-size: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      .landing-card {
        width: 95%;
        padding: 24px 16px;
        margin: 50px auto 20px;
      }

      .landing-logo-icon {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .landing-title {
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .landing-subtitle {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .landing-question {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .landing-features {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .landing-feature {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .landing-feature-icon {
        font-size: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .landing-feature-title {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .landing-feature-desc {
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .landing-cta-buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .landing-btn {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 14px 20px;
      }

      .landing-info-box {
        padding: 16px;
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .landing-info-box h3 {
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .landing-info-box li {
        font-size: 11px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .landing-footer {
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="landing-page">
  <div class="landing-page-wrapper">
    <!-- 왼쪽 상단 브랜드 -->
    <div class="landing-brand">
      <div class="landing-brand-text">
        <span class="line1">FORTUNE</span>
        <span class="line2">FOR YOU</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 중앙 랜딩 카드 -->
    <div class="landing-card">
      <!-- 헤더 -->
      <div class="landing-header">
        <div class="landing-logo-icon">💜</div>
        <h1 class="landing-title">Fortune For You</h1>
        <p class="landing-subtitle">
          사주 기반 궁합 분석과 소셜 플랫폼을 한 곳에서!<br>
          나와 잘 맞는 인연을 찾아보세요.
        </p>
        <p class="landing-question">당신은 운명을 믿으시나요? ✨</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 주요 기능 소개 -->
      <div class="landing-features">
        <div class="landing-feature">
          <div class="landing-feature-icon">🔮</div>
          <h3 class="landing-feature-title">사주 기반 궁합 분석</h3>
          <p class="landing-feature-desc">
            정확한 사주 정보를 바탕으로<br>
            과학적인 궁합 점수를 계산합니다
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="landing-feature">
          <div class="landing-feature-icon">💕</div>
          <h3 class="landing-feature-title">맞춤 추천 시스템</h3>
          <p class="landing-feature-desc">
            나와 가장 잘 맞는<br>
            상위 3명을 추천해드립니다
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="landing-feature">
          <div class="landing-feature-icon">💬</div>
          <h3 class="landing-feature-title">1:1 실시간 채팅</h3>
          <p class="landing-feature-desc">
            마음에 드는 상대와<br>
            안전하게 대화를 나눌 수 있습니다
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="landing-feature">
          <div class="landing-feature-icon">👥</div>
          <h3 class="landing-feature-title">활발한 커뮤니티</h3>
          <p class="landing-feature-desc">
            다양한 주제로<br>
            소통하고 정보를 공유하세요
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA 버튼 -->
      <div class="landing-cta">
        <div class="landing-cta-buttons">
          <a href="/auth/login" class="landing-btn landing-btn-primary">지금 시작하기</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 하단 푸터 -->
      <div class="landing-footer">
        © Fortune For You
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

